# CI/CD and branches

`main` is production. A product change goes on `cursor/<slice>`, one module on that branch, and lands through a pull request into `main`.

## CI

`.github/workflows/ci.yml` runs on every pull request and on every push to `main`, on Node.js 22:

- `npm run lint`
- `npm run typecheck`
- `npm run build`

Do not open the pull request while this check is red. Add any new automated test to this same workflow. The green check does not replace the browser check in `AGENTS.md`.

## CD

Vercel is the only deploy path. Production deploys from `main`. Every other pull request gets a Vercel preview. Do not add a GitHub Actions deploy job, and do not commit a Vercel token or any `.env` file.

`node_modules` and `.next` stay untracked.
